# oracle: fix nve/manifold/rattle on a sphere of radius 8 with fix langevin (the gjf formulation of the example has been removed from LAMMPS; examples/PACKAGES/manifold/diffusion/msd.sphere.in: 2000 free particles, pair_style none), 300 steps, with compute msd
# Native reference: LAMMPS b332f28 built with PKG_MANIFOLD (/store/shuvam/software/lammps-build-manifold/lmp; the installed binary has no MANIFOLD)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 2.4e-15, atoms 0.
# oracle-examples: PACKAGES/manifold/diffusion/msd.sphere.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
dimension       3
units           lj
boundary        f f f
read_data       msd.sphere.data
mass            1 1.0
pair_style      none
atom_modify     sort 0 1.0
variable        R equal 8
fix             step all nve/manifold/rattle 1e-4 4 sphere $R
fix             temp all langevin 1.0 1.0 1.0 12321
velocity        all create 1.0 1283
compute         dx2 all msd
thermo_style    custom time step pe ke etotal temp c_dx2[4]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          30
run             300
